      "message": "\u003e suggestion: `ref-update` event is well known part of the Gerrit but these tests started to look more like they were testing events together with the new functionality\n\nCorrect, this is a IT test suite, therefore their purpose is to test the functionality E2E, not testing a single aspect in isolation.\n\n\u003e - perhaps it would be enough to just test events in a single, dedicated test covering all cases: create, delete, fail to create etc... so that we confirm it works without affecting all of them? WDYT?\n\nThe approach I took is consistent with the other IT tests in Gerrit, where every functionality is tested E2E in isolation and has all the associated assertions. See, for example, the AccountIT.",
